    "stars": 4,
    "text": "Jesli ktoś ma czas by stać w kolejce (przy ok 12 osobach ok 1h oczekiwania) to warto. Fajnie zbalansowane sosy i ilość mięsa do warzyw, buła jednak średnia. Natomiast ogólny vibe, luźne, nieśpieszne podejście pracowników (młodych) nie każdemu podpasuje. Starszy Pan z obsługi cudowny - jak tylko się pojawił wszystko poszło szybciej. Warto mieć na uwadze, że jednak mało w tej kolejce lokalsów, głownie turyści.",
    "textTranslated": "If you have the time to wait in line (with about 12 people, the wait was about an hour), it's worth it. The sauces and the amount of meat and vegetables were nicely balanced, but the bread was average. However, the overall vibe, the relaxed, unhurried approach of the (young) staff, won't appeal to everyone. The older gentleman serving was wonderful – once he showed up, everything went faster. It's worth noting that there weren't many locals in the line, mostly tourists."
  },
